        <!-- Celebration, small (intensity 0): a jump, the arms up, a few sparks, a big grin and smiling eyes.
             The arms swing down as Pip falls and lands (frames 42 to 70), round the head's
             sides: each fist runs one smooth curve on an in-out ease, down beside the head,
             inside the frame through the landing's squash, and in under it to rest, never
             across the face (pip:build checks). The arm's turn, the hand's reach and the
             upper arm's stretch are keyed every other frame along that curve. -->
